(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
This notebook provides a small, reproducible demonstration of the \
competing-information diffusion model. 
It generates a communication network, initializes misinformation sources, \
runs one stochastic simulation, computes selected outcome measures, \
visualizes the misinformation and official-information trajectories, and \
exports the resulting demonstration data. 
The configuration is intentionally small and is not intended to reproduce the \
full production experiments reported in the associated article.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996933745042982*^9, 
  3.9969337629289055`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"df16cf42-3ed7-6f44-a522-\
45f0eec998bc"],

